NUM-20: give standard arch size code 31 its own full hydraulic radius

Rfull_Arch[] in src/legacy/engine/xsect.dat lists 0.773 ft for both size codes
30 (31 x 40 in) and 31 (36 x 46 in) of the corrugated-steel 3 x 1 in pipe
arches. Release 5.1.008 corrected the same duplication in Yfull_Arch[]
("31,31" -> "31,36") but not in Rfull_Arch[]. Every other entry of the group
is 0.2991 x rise, the ratio that xsect_setParams() also uses for non-standard
arches; for a 36 in rise that is 0.897 ft.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply NUM-20_swmm530.patch

